data: {"id": "2657b952014e4820-thinking-parallel_evidence-1945", "run_id": "2657b952014e4820", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 结果说明\n\n**Logging 维度：** 通过 `kubectl logs` 直接查询目标 Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w`，返回明确错误：`container \"app\" in pod \"workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w\" is waiting to start: ContainerCreating`。这确认了该 Pod 仍处于 `ContainerCreating` 阶段，尚未进入 `Running` 状态，因此无法获取应用日志。\n\n**与上一轮结果的关联：**\n- **Kubernetes 维度**：Pod 状态为 `ContainerCreating`，Events 显示 `MissingPodNetworkPod` 和 `ErrImagePull`，初步指向网络插件未就绪和镜像拉取失败。\n- **Metrics 维度**：`kube_pod_status_phase` 显示该 Pod 处于 `pending` 状态。\n- **Logging 维度**（本轮）：确认容器未启动，无法获取日志，与 `ContainerCrea", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788416480273, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "2657b952014e4820-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "2657b952014e4820", "seq": 1946, "ts_ms": 1788416488099, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 48.24, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/2657b952014e4820-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "c67727f4334ffee951a62fd606ee0cccf8187208e541d8cd3c983757675eb7aa", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "6adcad64c2dd43960b31d5beb5eb3c49fb8ca2729f8d02d1555c4deddb55438c"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "2657b952014e4820-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "2657b952014e4820", "seq": 1947, "ts_ms": 1788416488100, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "2657b952014e4820-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "2657b952014e4820", "seq": 1948, "ts_ms": 1788416499263, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 11.163, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 2063, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount 37s (x12 over 8m51s) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (`fact-9f726bb80ffe`) | 明确定位失败机制为 Volume 挂载失败，具体原因是 ConfigMap 缺失 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount 2m12s (x3 over 6m49s) kubelet Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` (`fact-1572411dc2a6`) | 佐证 Volume 长期处于未挂载状态，是配置错误的延续现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (`fact-2eac03371a74`); `pod.status: Pending` (`fact-5b630d3f95ce`); `pod.phase: Pending` (`fact-e3e70480b2d8`) | 定义 Pod 当前停滞状态，与挂载失败现象一致 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1` (labels: `container=app, reason=ContainerCreating`) (`fact-92770163df52`) | 独立观测指标验证 Pod 容器处于等待挂载的特定状态 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory: 8Mi` (`fact-1342ffa2b560`); `container.resource_limit.memory: 32Mi` (`fact-658b63a3fcd5`) | 确认资源限制配置已定义，排除资源不足导致的 Pending 可能 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件（#1, #2）与指标（#4）互相印证，明确指出容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态的原因是 `MountVolume.SetUp` 失败。事件数据进一步给出了决定性的失败原因：挂载 Volume `input` 所需的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 在命名空间 `aiops-case-03` 中不存在（#1）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 缺失 (事实#1) → Kubelet 无法挂载 Volume 'input' (事实#1) → MountVolume.SetUp 失败 (事实#1) → Pod 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态 (事实#2, #4)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 的容器启动失败，根本原因是其引用的 Volume `input` 绑定的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 不存在。\n\n- 该缺失导致 Kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时直接报错 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（证据 #1），从而无法完成 Volume 挂载。\n- 这一机制直接导致容器无法启动，Pod 状态长期停留在 `ContainerCreating`（等待中）和 `Pending`，被事件和指标一致捕获（证据 #2, #4）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount 37s (x12 over 8m51s) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (`fact-9f726bb80ffe`) | 明确定位失败机制为 Volume 挂载失败，具体原因是 ConfigMap 缺失 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount 2m12s (x3 over 6m49s) kubelet Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` (`fact-1572411dc2a6`) | 佐证 Volume 长期处于未挂载状态，是配置错误的延续现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (`fact-2eac03371a74`); `pod.status: Pending` (`fact-5b630d3f95ce`); `pod.phase: Pending` (`fact-e3e70480b2d8`) | 定义 Pod 当前停滞状态，与挂载失败现象一致 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1` (labels: `container=app, reason=ContainerCreating`) (`fact-92770163df52`) | 独立观测指标验证 Pod 容器处于等待挂载的特定状态 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory: 8Mi` (`fact-1342ffa2b560`); `container.resource_limit.memory: 32Mi` (`fact-658b63a3fcd5`) | 确认资源限制配置已定义，排除资源不足导致的 Pending 可能 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件（#1, #2）与指标（#4）互相印证，明确指出容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态的原因是 `MountVolume.SetUp` 失败。事件数据进一步给出了决定性的失败原因：挂载 Volume `input` 所需的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 在命名空间 `aiops-case-03` 中不存在（#1）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 缺失 (事实#1) → Kubelet 无法挂载 Volume 'input' (事实#1) → MountVolume.SetUp 失败 (事实#1) → Pod 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态 (事实#2, #4)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 的容器启动失败，根本原因是其引用的 Volume `input` 绑定的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 不存在。\n\n- 该缺失导致 Kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时直接报错 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（证据 #1），从而无法完成 Volume 挂载。\n- 这一机制直接导致容器无法启动，Pod 状态长期停留在 `ContainerCreating`（等待中）和 `Pending`，被事件和指标一致捕获（证据 #2, #4）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

