onfigMap `unavailable-config` 不存在。\n\n- 该缺失导致 Kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时直接报错 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（证据 #1），从而无法完成 Volume 挂载。\n- 这一机制直接导致容器无法启动，Pod 状态长期停留在 `ContainerCreating`（等待中）和 `Pending`，被事件和指标一致捕获（证据 #2, #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 48.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w: 48.2s (Evidence 40.5s, RCA 7.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 79.816, "metrics": {"run_id": "2657b952014e4820", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 79.8161563873291, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail